  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MoonRabbit.World::MoonRabbit.World.StoryIntro
  playIntro: 1
  lines:
  - "It's Chuseok, Earth's harvest moon festival\u2026\nbut the Moon never rose."
  - No wishes. No mochi. No festival.
  - In the sky garden between Earth and Moon, the Moon Rabbits pick up the mallet.
  - '!Pound the mochi. Light the Moon.'
